  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the 6' bed of 2005-2015 Toyota Tacoma with the deck rail system. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2005-2015 Toyota Tacoma fleetside 6' bed with Deck Rail System\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nGreat Fit:\nReliable manufacture brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to\nensure precise compatibility with the 6' bed of 2005-2015 Tacoma.\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with\nadjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user\nfriendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nSafety First: Reinforced corner design keeps the cover tight to the\nbed; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from\nsliding or blowing off while driving.\nHigh Quality: Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with\nsolid alloy in the frame, this back cover is build to last for your\ntruck.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high\ntemperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is\nlike, we’ve got you covered.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.",
